{"text":"So, because gender can be, actually, Women Wrap Up was part of the longer version of this talk, so because gender can be a very uncomfortable conversation to have, there are very easy ways to close it, to close the conversation. So, some people will bring up evolutionary biology and apes, how female apes bow down to male apes, and that sort of thing, but the point is we're not apes. Apes also live on trees and have earthworms for breakfast, and we don't. Some people will say, well, poor men also have a hard time, and this is true.","words":[{"text":"So","start":1.8,"end":2.28,"punct":","},{"text":"because","start":2.28,"end":2.28},{"text":"gender","start":2.28,"end":2.64},{"text":"can","start":2.64,"end":3.08},{"text":"be","start":3.08,"end":3.3,"punct":","},{"text":"actually","start":3.3,"end":12.96,"punct":","},{"text":"Women","start":14.16,"end":14.16},{"text":"Wrap","start":14.16,"end":14.36},{"text":"Up","start":14.36,"end":14.46},{"text":"was","start":14.46,"end":14.62},{"text":"part","start":14.62,"end":14.76},{"text":"of","start":14.76,"end":14.9},{"text":"the","start":14.9,"end":15.0},{"text":"longer","start":15.0,"end":15.36},{"text":"version","start":15.36,"end":16.14},{"text":"of","start":16.14,"end":16.32},{"text":"this","start":16.32,"end":16.48},{"text":"talk","start":16.48,"end":16.74,"punct":","},{"text":"so","start":18.2,"end":18.2},{"text":"because","start":18.2,"end":18.48},{"text":"gender","start":18.48,"end":18.78},{"text":"can","start":18.78,"end":19.02},{"text":"be","start":19.02,"end":19.16},{"text":"a","start":19.16,"end":19.24},{"text":"very","start":19.24,"end":20.0},{"text":"uncomfortable","start":20.0,"end":20.58},{"text":"conversation","start":20.58,"end":21.14},{"text":"to","start":21.14,"end":21.44},{"text":"have","start":21.44,"end":21.64,"punct":","},{"text":"there","start":21.8,"end":21.8},{"text":"are","start":21.8,"end":22.08},{"text":"very","start":22.08,"end":22.08},{"text":"easy","start":22.08,"end":22.3},{"text":"wa